# Supershop Management System

A modular console-based Supershop Management System developed using C.

## Features

* Admin authentication
* Customer registration and login
* Product management
* Add, update, delete, and search products
* Order placement and order history
* Customer order tracking
* Admin order summaries and total calculations

## Technical Concepts

* C Programming
* Structures
* Singly Linked List
* Dynamic Memory Management
* Modular Programming
* Header Files
* Doxygen Documentation

## Project Structure

The project is organized into separate modules for:

* Admin Management
* Customer Management
* Product Management
* Order Management
